Doco-CD fork for Portico v2 (luca-polignone-org/doco-cd)
Based on Doco-CD by kimdre, https://github.com/kimdre/doco-cd, Apache License 2.0.

Modifications (from v0.127.0):
- internal/auth/jwt, internal/rbac: JWT (JWKS) authentication and Argo CD-style RBAC for REST and MCP
- internal/composepolicy: compose policy and target/repository binding
- internal/rollback: on-disk failure store, last good deployment, local rollback
- internal/hooks: pre_rollback veto and outcome events (signed, outbox)
- cmd/doco-cd/version.go: version check against the fork base version
All modifications are disabled unless their configuration keys are set.
